Package: scBrailleR
Title: Accessible Text Descriptions of Single-Cell Plots
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Ben", family = "Carrillo", email = "ben.uzh@proton.me",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Extends BrailleR with VI() and Augment() methods for plots
    commonly produced in single-cell RNA-seq analysis, for Seurat and
    SingleCellExperiment objects. Provides spoken/braille-friendly summaries that report
    cluster-, gene-, and component-level facts rather than purely
    visual properties.
